  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II SENUPH II Public Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SENUPH II project aims to improve post graduate studies and research in public health, and contribute with the relevant health information to improve the health of peoples in southern Ethiopia. By focusing on infectious diseases, malnutrition and the emerging burden og non-communicable diseases, the project aims to build capacity in higher education both at universities and at the Ministry of Health.</narrative>
  </description>
